title AVG-01 Create Proof Request (x401 Challenge)
participant Calling_Agent
participant Service
participant AVG
==STEPS 3 TO 5==
Calling_Agent->Service:3. call service (API / MCP / A2A)
Service->AVG:4. create proof request (API key, required credential, requested claims, service reference)
AVG->AVG:check API key valid, service Active, rate limit (60/min), claims within Allowed Claims, credential not broader than onboarded
AVG->AVG:create proofRequestId + x401 challenge (nonce >= 128-bit, 5 min, single use); add service name + did:zid, template IDs and issuer from AVG config, verifier ID, submit URL; store it
AVG-->Service:OID4VP proof request (not signed in Phase 1)
Service-->Calling_Agent:5. proof request, passed unchanged
alt INVALID OR REVOKED API KEY
AVG-->Service:401 INVALID_API_KEY
end
alt SERVICE SUSPENDED OR DELISTED
AVG-->Service:403 SERVICE_SUSPENDED
end
alt CLAIMS OUTSIDE ALLOWED LIST OR CREDENTIAL TOO BROAD
AVG-->Service:400 CLAIMS_NOT_ALLOWED / CREDENTIAL_REQUIREMENT_TOO_LOW
end
alt OVER RATE LIMIT
AVG-->Service:429 RATE_LIMITED + Retry-After
end
